    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "version": "3.22.0",
      "release_date": "2025-12-28",
      "release_notes": "The first non-beta release of nomacs in quite some time. Thanks to everyone who helped! 🎉 🍾 🍾 🍾 🎉\nWhat’s Changed Since 3.21.1\nHighlights\n- Color Management — @scrubbbbs (#1454)\n- Proper HiDPI rendering (1:1 pixels at 100%) — @scrubbbbs (#1382)\n- Much better ZIP archive support — @scrubbbbs (#1314)\n- Faster, lighter thumbnails — @leejuyuu (#1262)\n- Improved comments & ratings — @leejuyuu (#1374, #1357)\n- New Simplified Chinese translation by @sr79368142 (#1449)\n- Translation work from past several years imported from CrowdIn (#1396)\n- Translation project revived on CrowdIn under nomacs-neo (#1396)\nShortcuts & Input\n- Shortcut focus and activation fixes — @scrubbbbs (#1256)\n- Keyboard scrolling in thumbnail view — @spaghetti22 (#1448)\nUI & Theme\n- Theme reliability and animation fixes — @scrubbbbs (#1326, #1291, #1412)\nBug Fixes\n- Rendering & animation fixes (pseudocolor, slides, rotation) — @scrubbbbs (#1364, #1466, #1453)\n- Navigation & interaction fixes (HUD input, zoom behavior, history) — @scrubbbbs (#1410, #1418, #1429)\n- File handling fixes (single-file dirs, ZIPs, thumbnails, save prompts) — @leejuyuu, @scrubbbbs (#1386, #1380, #1331, #1404)\nPackaging & Builds\n- AppImage support and fixes — @scrubbbbs (#1425, #1471, #1472, #1457)\n- Improved plugin loading on Unix — @scrubbbbs (#1350)\n- macOS CI and code signing — @scrubbbbs (#1443, #1470)\n- Windows build updates (Qt 6.9.3, OpenCV 4.12.0) — @novomesk (#1444, #1409)\nMaintenance\n- Drop Qt5; Qt 6 cleanup — @leejuyuu, @scrubbbbs (#1343, #1347)\n- CMake modernisation — @scrubbbbs, @novomesk (#1367, #1424, #1458)\n- Warnings, formatting, clang-tidy, headers — @scrubbbbs (#1369, #1375, #1405)\n- Translations re-enabled; plugins merged — @scrubbbbs (#1396, #1349)\nNew Contributors\n- @maurolacy (#1385)\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/nomacs/nomacs/compare/3.21.1...3.22.0\nSecurity Scan\nWindows zip\nWindows msi\nmacOS ARM\nmacOS x86_64\nLinux AppImage 22.04\nLinux AppImage 24.04",
      "release_notes_url": "https://github.com/nomacs/nomacs/releases/tag/3.22.0",
